rules have almost certainly changed since last I looked).

It *might* be possible to trace everything back to your *system* serial
number but I doubt that you will be successful in that. Much better to
put your CPU back in before it gets damaged and hop on over to
www.montagar.com and pick up one of those nice shiny hobbyist licences.

Your chances of getting FORTRAN (or almost any layered product) transferred
*if* you have the original paper work are nil. Without the paper work it's
down to nil-squared :-)

Antonio
 
