machine time to people as a business.  However, in my case, I
do not want to become an "expert" in the OS that I'm using to
get other kinds of work done (and I've been in an OS development
business for 25 years so I do know what I'm talking about).  All
I want, for now, is access to newsgroups, certain places on the
web and e-mail.  In other words, I want to just dial-in to a
timesharing service and let that service have the soft/hardware
