Hi,

Because the flash EEPROM on the AXPpci33 is too small, it's possible to load
only an firmware environment at once. So, if you want to use Windows NT, you
MUST reload the flash memory with the ARC firmware from a firmware update
CD-ROM.

You can find more about this operation on the Digital WEB Site.

