	uudecode to translate them to binary -- I guess you stored them
with the .doc extension and the browsers are basing their identification
purely on the filetype and not on any information contained in the files.

	The "begin xxx filename", and all lines starting with M except
possibly the last are signatures of uuencoded files.  You shold get more
information with "man uudecode" on your UNIX box.

