As Peter pointed out in a private e-mail exchange, my method will
get the right path of parents, but I forgot about verifying the
name of '.'.

The solution is to add something like this to my previously
posted pseudo-code
  ...
  dotbynamestatus=stat("../" + name);
  if dotstatus.inode != dotbynamestatus.inode ||
     dotstatus.device != dotbynamestatus.inode
       error!

