>> >Peter da Silva wrote:
>> >> W="`    '"'$"'          # whitespacish type stuff we want to skip
>> >> find /tmp -type f -mtime +7 -print | grep '^/tmp' | grep -v "$W" |
>> >>   while read victim
>> >>   do
>> >>     d=`dirname "$victim"`
>> >>     f=`basename "$victim"`
