Isn't there a way to test stability of device drivers in
VMS?  What I mean: if there is a buggy driver it could cause
a crash potentially; so it seems beneficial to be able to
test those things before putting machine into production.
Stress-test all components so that most paths in device
drivers are covered. This is a bit different than pure
hardware diagnostic, like RAM testing. Those 2 modes of
diagnostics complement each other instead of replacing.
My interest is NT. Test tools I just described seem to be
missing in NT. So I'd like to know if smthg like that exists
in VMS.

