>Peter da Silva <peter@baileynm.com> wrote:
>>                          PS: how do you specify resolver order in NT?
>
>Well, it's *dead* easy :-).

(snip)

Unfortunately, it doesn't really answer the question. You're simply changing
the name server lookup order, not the resolver order. NT does WINS, then DNS,
then LMHOSTS, then broadcast. You can disable one or more of 'em, but you can't
change the order (at least through the control panel . . . there may be some
obscure registry setting that allows you to redefine it, but I'm not in the
mood to go RegSurfing right now).

