non-reproducable series of events in just the right order and at
just the right time fucked something up.  If the problem does become
chronic, then you waste the time tracking it down.  Other than that,
you move on to the next few dozen jobs you've got to get done before
lunch.  While finding the exact, specific cause may be an
interesting academic exercise, there isn't time for that at least
not in our shop.

