I just started a new mailing list for people who would like to sell or
buy older and used computers.  Send a message to
"ouc-subscribe@sevensages.org" to be added to the list.  Make sure it
has your correct email address in the "From" or "Reply-To:" header.  You
don't need to give it any special commands.

