"old-usedcmp@sevensages.org".  This list is not for discussions, simply
telling people what you have, what you want, what you want to trade,
etc.  It is not for PCs or x86 boxes!  There is a seperate list for
that.  You can subscribe to that one at "upcs-sub@sevensages.org" and to
send to that list, use "used-pcs@sevensages.org".

