	And that takes how much time again...?  Oh, I remember; zero
seconds on DEC, SGI, HP, CONVEX, HARRIS, CRAY.  A couple hours to
straighten out SUN's screwup on a few hundred workstations.

	The fact that 'you can fix it' does nothing to mitigate the reality
that it should never have been a problem in the first place.  The
fact that I can replace a power supply doesn't mean that the
original one wasn't faulty.

> > > see auto-install. Make all your machines easy to install. Never worry
> > > about mapping again. I don't see why this is such a big deal. Many
> > > applications have their own idea of which should be which anyway. In some
> > > apps, delete acts like backspace and deletes the object to the left of
