Well, among other places, the color video card model is usually printed on the
output connector mounting plate.  Usually of the form "PMAGx-vv", where "x" is
optional and "vv" is usually a variant.

Also, while at the console prompt:

        >> cnfg
        
will get a listing of what's on the machine.

