Ev6 systems were not available for customer shipment at that time,
but there were 'plenty' for early evaluation/testing. They will be
shipping to customers within the timeframe stipulated by the SAP 
benchmark rules.

To upgrade a turbolaser to Ev6, just swap in the boards, and adjust
the clock module. No muss no fuss ('cept for getting the modules)

fwiw, there were 'only' 40 rackmount 3 CPU AS4100 system for app servers.
Those systems were not at all loaded to capacity as this was not a 
benchmark goal, so we wanted plenty of driving power to spare 'just in case'
Obviously we could have used a much smaller number of Turbolasers instead.

Regards,
	Hein van den Heuvel.



