Again, be aware that I missed bits of this thread, but since you have
the RRD40-DC and *not* the RRD40-DA (SCSI), a SCSI card is no good
for hooking up the RRD40 - you need a Q-bus system and a KRQ50 interface
card and the appropriate cable. If the SCSI card comment was for something
else, then ignore me :-)

