|>since I still have the original T2011-YA card
|>from what's now the 6220.  (It was a 6310 also)  Will need to fix S/n's and
|>EEPROM data to match up first though.
|>I'm toying with the idea of getting some KDB50's and doing away with the
|>HSC.
