The EV6/8400 SPEC benchmark results posted by Compaq
in July 98 quote a hardware availability date of 
November 98 for that combination. SPEC tend to 
get annoyed if you miss the availability dates so
you should assume November.

Of course the question as to whether the EV6/8400 
combination is a good idea depends on your 
view point. The SPECrate_fp95 scalability 
results for the EV6/8400 should be enough to 
put anyone off who thinks their application 
consumes memory bandwidth.

Note if you are looking for the 8400 SPEC results 
they are at http://www.specbench.org
but listed under Compaq not Digital. 

