Hi,

You have to an indexed f$search, eg

  $ SEARCH_FILE = F$SEARCH(FILE_TO_DELETE, I_COUNT)

                                       Where I_COUNT is set to some integer.

This is required where you want to keep the context of the search you are
doing....

You can have multiple contexts (or indexed searches), but the whole thing
gets pretty horrible....

Checkout the help on $ help lex f$search, or the examples in the DCL books.


