According to my (selfprint) manual for a 21066A  J7 should be set:

Pin 1-2  jumper on
Pin 3-4 jumper off
Pin 5-6 jumper on

It also says: "For 233 MHz operation the minimum firmware revision is Version
1.3"
So maybe you have the 233 MHz chip but older firmware.
My DEC AXP-PCI33 system has 233 MHz chip and gives under Linux 228.59
BogoMips.
(it should be close to the clock frequency)

